Package: pulsaros-settings
Version: 1.0.1
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: python3-gi, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, pulsaros-live-wallpaper
Description: macOS-styled System Settings application for Pulsar OS.
 Provides macOS style System Settings with native Live Wallpaper manager,
 cursor preview, macOS keyboard remapping, and extension controls.
